<concept_spec>

concept ShareLink

purpose
  to generate trackable share links for projects with referral attribution

state
  a set of ShareLinks with
    an id String
    a projectId String
    a userId String (who created the link)
    a code String (unique shareable code)
    a createdAt Date
    an updatedAt Date
    a clickCount Number
    an lastClickedAt Date?

actions
  createOrGet(userId: String, projectId: String) -> ShareLink | {error}
    - create a new share link or return existing one
    - generate unique code if creating new
    - one unique code per user-project combination
    - return share link with code

  trackClick(code: String, referrerId: String?) -> ShareLink | {error}
    - increment click count for share link
    - update lastClickedAt timestamp
    - optionally track who clicked (referrerId)
    - return updated share link

  incrementClicks(code: String) -> ShareLink | {error}
    - increment click count
    - update lastClickedAt
    - return updated share link

queries
  _getByCode(code: String) -> ShareLink?
    - return share link by unique code

  _getByUser(userId: String) -> [ShareLink]
    - return all share links created by user

  _getByProject(projectId: String) -> [ShareLink]
    - return all share links for a project

  _getByUserAndProject(userId: String, projectId: String) -> ShareLink?
    - return share link for specific user-project combination

  _getStats(userId: String) -> {totalLinks: Number, totalClicks: Number}
    - return aggregated statistics for user's share links

operational principle
  Users can generate unique shareable links for projects. After createOrGet(userId: "user1", projectId: "proj123"), a unique code is generated. When someone clicks the link with that code, trackClick(code: "ABC123") increments the counter, allowing the creator to track engagement.

</concept_spec>
